3. RFC 8032 reference implementation -- public domain
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`ffn_ed25519.py` is derived from the Ed25519 reference implementation published
in RFC 8032 section 7, which is placed in the public domain. The known-answer
test vectors in that module and in `ffn_fips_selftest.py` are the published
NIST and RFC test vectors; they are standards material and carry no secret.

(If a secret scanner flags those vectors, that is a false positive. See
`.gitleaks.toml`.)


